OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust to review 4,500 more
OL,4,Abreast cancer cases after failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospital chiefs in County Durham have
OL,7,Fagreed to review up to a further 4,500
OL,8,Fbreast cancer cases after failings
OL,9,Fincluding delayed diagnoses and
OL,10,Funnecessary surgeries were found.
OL,12,FHundreds of patients suffered harm
OL,13,Funder County Durham and Darlington NHS
OL,14,FFoundation Trust, according to a review
OL,15,Fof cases dating back to 2023.
OL,17,FThe BBC previously investigated the
OL,18,Ffailings and has spoken to multiple
OL,19,Fwomen affected, including one who said
OL,20,Fshe felt "mutilated" and the trust's
OL,21,Fmistakes were "absolutely
OL,22,Funforgivable".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
