OL,3,GNEWSANHS trust to review 4,500 more
OL,4,Abreast cancer cases after failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of agreeing to expand the review
OL,7,Fto cases dating back to 2015, members
OL,8,Fof the trust's board offered "sincere"
OL,9,Fapologies for the failings and harm
OL,10,Fcaused.
